sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Player
    participant FE as Static front end
    participant API as API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant PSP as Payment provider

    P->>FE: request deposit
    FE->>API: POST deposit with Idempotency-Key
    API->>API: rate limit by IP and user
    API->>DB: lock user, look up key, sum day's deposits
    API->>DB: insert pending deposit, commit
    API->>PSP: create checkout session
    PSP-->>API: session id, URL, expiry
    API->>DB: persist session id, URL, expiry
    API-->>FE: checkout URL and expiry
    FE-->>P: redirect to provider page
    Note over P,PSP: checkout session and Pix charge expire on separate 30 minute clocks
    P->>PSP: pay the Pix charge
    PSP->>API: signed webhook, session completed and paid
    API->>API: verify HMAC over raw body
    API->>DB: lock user and deposit, confirm pending
    API->>DB: post ledger transaction with session key
    API->>DB: mark deposit paid
    API-->>PSP: 200
    FE->>API: refresh wallet
    API->>DB: read materialised balance
    API-->>FE: balance from the ledger
